,"head_icon":"515501.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["唔……从什么时候讲起呢？十二年前的故事似乎不错，那时候我还是一位出色的船长，带领着两位不成器的属下，在责任感与信念的驱使下，守护着这座岛屿……","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"64":{"step":[[64,65,""]],"type":1,"name":["杜卡特","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"515501.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["在这期间，我们驱赶了试图将这座岛屿据为己有的贪婪富翁，救助了拒饮海水而几乎渴死的滴水嘴兽……","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"65":{"step":[[65,66,""]],"type":1,"name":["杜卡特","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"515501.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["在这些故事之中，老杜卡特始终凭借着他的经验与智慧，发挥着无可置疑的重要作用。只可惜，一场意外彻底地改变了他……","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"66":{"step":[[66,67,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["年长的幽灵喋喋不休地回忆着，无不得意地瞥了瞥一旁的两人。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"67":{"step":[[67,68,""]],"type":1,"name":["马歇尔","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"515401.png","audio":"610017963","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["嘿，这完全不对——！这些乱七八糟的东西完全与我们的死亡无关，它们根本无法吸引读者的兴趣！","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"68":{"step":[[68,69,""]],"type":1,"name":["唐纳德","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"515301.png","audio":"610017931","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["杜卡特先生……你说得太、太啰嗦了……我的故事、更有趣……","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"69":{"step":[[69,70,""]],"type":1,"name":["杜卡特","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"515501.png","audio":"610017935","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["臭小子们，你们完全忽略了一位前辈对于航道、对于故事的掌舵能力！只要听我的安排，小马库斯就能写出一篇完美的故事！","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"70":{"step":[[70,71,""]],"type":1,"name":["唐纳德","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"515301.png","audio":"610017930","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["可大家关心的不、不只是你……一个……","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"71":{"step":[[71,72,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["积极的幽灵们忙不迭地凑近了马库斯，积极地在稿纸上争抢着愈发稀缺的篇幅。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"72":{"step":[[72,73,""]],"type":1,"name":["马库斯","","Marcus","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["先生们，你们可以一个一个来……","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"73":{"step":[[73,74,""]],"type":1,"name":["马歇尔","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"515401.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["接下来你将听到最有趣的故事，马库斯，这要从我在岛上的第一年冬天说起——！","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"74":{"step":[[74,75,""]],"type":1,"name":["马歇尔","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"515401.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["那一天，不少人都来到了这里，警官先生、北方灯塔委员会的维修人员，他们搜刮走了我的油皮防水外套，捣鼓着那座停摆的时钟……","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/1_7/1_7_bg_at_haidao.jpg","choice":[]},"75":{"step":[[75,76,""]],"type":1,"name":["马歇尔","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"515401.png","audio":"610017968","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["我远远地看着他们，向他们挥手，但没有一个人注意到我。很快，意外发生了——","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"76":{"step":[[76,77,""]],"type":1,"name":["马歇尔","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"515401.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["遮天蔽日的浓雾弥漫了弗兰南周边的所有群岛，再好的望远镜也无法看清哪怕半海里以外的东西。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"77":{"step":[[77,78,""]],"type":1,"name":["马歇尔","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"515401.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["人们陷入了慌乱，紧接着，潮湿的水汽把所有人的帽子、皮带都浇透了，我的身体也逐渐变得透明……","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"78":{"step":[[78,79,""]],"type":1,"name":["马歇尔","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"515401.png","audio":"610017959","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["突然间，巨大的震声越来越近，当我抬头望去，那是一场席卷了几乎半座岛屿的巨浪……","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/1_7/1_7_bg_at_haidao.jpg","choice":[]},"79":{"step":[[79,80,""]],"type":1,"name":["马歇尔","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"515401.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["它卷起了所有人，活着的人，把他们扔上那些小小的船只。当我擦去眼眶上的水雾后，我惊奇地发现，浓雾消散了，船只们安稳地停泊在了五海里以外的地方。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"80":{"step":[[80,138,""]],"type":1,"name":["马歇尔","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"515401.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["他们在我的眼中迅速地离去了，时速甚至超过了14海里——！","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"81":{"step":[[81,82,""]],"type":1,"name":["马库斯","","Marcus","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"610017975","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["天啊，马歇尔先生，您的经历真是令人难以相信……","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/1_7/1_7_bg_at_haidao.jpg","choice":[]},"82":{"step":[[82,83,""]],"type":1,"name":["马歇尔","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"515401.png","audio":"610017956","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["事实就是这样，它一直在我的脑子里打转，直到现在。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"83":{"step":[[83,84,""]],"type":1,"name":["唐纳德","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"515301.png","audio":"610017927","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["他、他说得一点儿也不全面……马库斯。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"84":{"step":[[84,85,""]],"type":1,"name":["马歇尔","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"515401.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["停止你的污蔑，唐纳德！我保证，任何一个读者都会为此动容！","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"85":{"step":[[85,86,""]],"type":1,"name":["马歇尔","","","","